# Tavern Ruffian, a french vanilla creature: cast with Black Lotus mana, its characteristics as printed (power, toughness,
# keywords, colors, types, protection).
# Daybound: it became day as it entered (CR 702.145d); Bot2 cast no spells on their turn, so it becomes night in
# Bot1's next untap step (CR 731.2a), and as it does the permanent transforms to its nightbound face (CR 702.145b).

